<title>USA: Chrysler achieves record minivan sales in '96.</title>
<headline>Chrysler achieves record minivan sales in '96.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp said on Monday that it would set a new calendar-year record for minivan sales in 1996, surpassing the previous all-time high of 513,163 sold in 1994.</p>
<p>From January 1 through December 13, 1996, Chrysler sold 514,786 of its Dodge Caravan, Plymouth Voyager and Chrysler Town &amp; Country minivans.</p>
<p>Chrysler said its minivan market share for the first 11 months was 46.9 percent, up from 41.9 percent in the same period last year.</p>
</text>
